<subpara id="RM0000022AQ00MX_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000DAA00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The battery current sensor assembly detects the amount of battery charge/discharge current. The battery current sensor assembly converts the signal into a voltage and outputs it to the engine control computer. Based on this signal, the engine control computer commands the generating voltage of the alternator.</ptxt>
